      <p class="lead">Every stage of apparel production under one roof. No subcontracting. No split production. No quality gaps between departments — because there are no departments in different buildings.</p>
      <div class="g2" style="margin-top:1.4rem;">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="h3">🏭 Facility</div>
          <p class="body">Purpose-built 75,000 sq ft in Dhaka with separate production lines for knitwear, woven apparel, and outerwear. Each line has dedicated supervisors, in-line quality controllers, and its own fabric store to prevent cross-contamination between categories. The facility sits within direct logistics reach of Chittagong port (FOB ocean freight) and Dhaka airport (DHL Express samples and air freight).</p>
