        <div class="card">
          <div class="h3">🔬 Quality Control</div>
          <p class="body">ISO 9001 certified quality management system with four inspection points: 4-point fabric inspection before cutting, cut-panel audit, in-line sewing check (every 50th piece during production), and AQL 2.5 final inspection of packed cartons. Third-party inspection available from SGS, Bureau Veritas, and Intertek. Spectrophotometer colour matching for batch consistency across production runs.</p>
