      <div class="fq-box">
        <p class="fq-text">"When we started SDF Clothing in 1998, the goal was not to be the cheapest apparel factory in Bangladesh. It was to be the most trustworthy. We believed — and still believe — that a Bangladesh apparel manufacturer can deliver the same quality as any factory in Europe, with the same ethical standards and the same supply chain transparency. {yearsExp}+ years later, 200+ international brands agree. Every certification, every documented process, every worker trained — all of it serves one purpose: when a brand sources apparel from SDF Clothing, they know exactly what they are getting and where it came from."</p>
